y in older adults across different income countries.", "KOWAL P:Kowal P is a researcher involved in studies on aging and health.", "STRULIK H:Strulik H is a researcher who has contributed to studies on frailty in older adults.", "CHATTERJI S:Chatterji S is a researcher involved in the Survey of Health, Ageing and Retirement in Europe.", "VOLLMER S:Vollmer S is a researcher who has worked on aging and health studies.", "BAUMGARTNER RN:Baumgartner RN is a researcher who has studied the epidemiology of sarcopenia among the elderly.", "FIELDING RA:Fielding RA is a researcher who has contributed to the consensus definition of sarcopenia.", "MUSCARITOLI M:Muscaritoli M is a prominent author and researcher in the fields of nutrition and oncology. He has made significant contributions to the guidelines on enteral nutrition specifically tailored for oncology patients. Additionally, Muscaritoli M has played a crucial role in defining key concepts such as sarcopenia, cachexia, and pre-cachexia, which are critical in understanding the nutritional challenges faced by patients with chronic diseases. His research also explores the intricate relationship between sarcopenia and various chronic conditions. Furthermore, Muscaritoli M has contributed to the European Respiratory Society's statement on nutritional assessment and therapy in chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD), highlighting his commitment to improving nutritional care in respiratory illnesses.", "DHILLON RJS:Dhillon RJS is a researcher discussing the pathogenesis and management of sarcopenia."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}